### tools/list
POST http://localhost:8181/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"method":"tools/list","params":{}}

### list_directory
POST http://localhost:8181/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"list_directory","arguments":{"path":"/tmp"}}}

### read_file
POST http://localhost:8181/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":3,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"read_file","arguments":{"path":"/tmp/hello.txt"}}}

### search_in_files
POST http://localhost:8181/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":4,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"search_in_files","arguments":{"directory":"/tmp","pattern":"hello","fileExtension":"*","maxResults":50}}}

### file_info
POST http://localhost:8181/mcp
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json, text/event-stream

{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":5,"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"file_info","arguments":{"path":"/tmp"}}}
